rowhammer (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The prompt that asks for the name at the end of a round now shows the
    play time to the millisecond (MM:SS.mmm) in every game mode, the way
    the Ultra highscore list shows it (user request). In Ultra the time
    is the score and two attempts routinely land in the same second, so
    MM:SS cut off exactly the digits that decide the place the prompt
    names right below the time.
