rowhammer (0.31.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Change the default key bindings (user decision): rotation moved from
    q/e to a (counter-clockwise) and d (clockwise), and the fixed
    secondary hold key changed from 2 to w. Those three letters were
    bound to moving left/right and to the hard drop, so both actions now
    rely on their fixed secondary keys only - the arrow keys for moving,
    space and arrow up for the hard drop - and carry no letter key in the
    default layout.
  * Add NONE as a key binding value ("this action has no letter key"),
    the new default for KEY_LEFT/KEY_RIGHT. It is the one value several
    actions may share (exempt from the duplicate check) and can never
    collide with a real key press, since read_key only reports single
    characters or the names LEFT/RIGHT/UP/DOWN/SPACE/ENTER/ESC. A letter
    can be assigned again at any time in the settings menu.

