rowhammer (0.28.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the key press artifacts left on screen (issue #33): the terminal
    is now switched into raw input mode once in term_setup (stty -echo
    -icanon min 1 time 0) instead of relying on the mode a single
    "read -rsn1" installs for its own duration. Keys pressed between two
    reads - while a frame is drawn, during the row-clear flash and on the
    pause and game over screens - were echoed by the terminal next to the
    board, and since only changed lines are rewritten (0.22.0) nothing
    painted over them again.
