rowhammer (0.19.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Handle terminal resizing while the game runs (SIGWINCH). The fixed
    board+sidebar layout still needs at least 48x24, but a resize is now
    caught live: the screen is cleared and redrawn cleanly, and shrinking
    the terminal below the minimum pauses the round behind a compact
